.TH NN-MEMORY 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-memory \- analyze model memory requirements
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn memory
[\fIoptions\fR]
.I model
.SH DESCRIPTION
Estimate weight storage, activation lifetimes, and peak RAM. Figures that are estimated rather than measured are labeled as such.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-timeline
Print tensor lifetime timeline.
.TP
.B \-\-plan
Print a static arena plan.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH SEE ALSO
nn(1), nn-inspect(1), nn-target(1)
